					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-471392#post-2136576</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-471392/scp-095-j#post-2136576</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 21 Oct 2014 18:07:55 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Lonewolf</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1300064</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I am a graphic designer. I do not hate Comic Sans. I dislike that many people will go &quot;Oh, that looks nice&quot; and use it in inappropriate places. It is the same problem I had with people outlining and drop-shadowing letters in the early days 'because they could.'</p> <p>But maybe my mind is just strong enough (or overfilled with fonts) to resist Comic Sans. If it was actually anomalous, it would explain why I see so many wedding invites written in it. Because that's what boggles me. &quot;Honey, what do you think of these invites I made?&quot; &quot;Aw, that font is SO cute!&quot; ?????</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
