						 <p>I began reaching for the downvote button the moment I realised this article to be about Comic Sans. Only the second picture and the final comment exchange have stayed my hand. IMHO it would be much better if it concentrated on the &quot;someone in the Foundation obsessively hates Comic Sans&quot; aspect rather than on the font itself&#8230; Salman's -J on insects springs to mind here. As it is, no vote.</p> 
