					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love you. You have taken something I hate and turned it into awesomeness. If I could upvote twice, I would.</p> <p>Why no, I've never been trapped in a small office whose walls are almost entirely covered in notices printed in that font because of one person who loved it just a little too much. Just looking at it makes me twitch and contemplate dismemberment of the perpetrator. It makes complete and logical sense that it's a memetic hazard, the way it infects seemingly perfectly sensible, normal people.</p> <p>Most excellent. Have an upvote. :)</p> 
				 	]]>
